  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "When Wu Lan Shan dies inside the three kings inheritance, mysterious light bursts from her body, envelops her three rank five Gu worms, tears through space, and carries them away. Fang Yuan is not surprised; he knows Wu clan holds this rank six Immortal Gu. The blessed land can restrict Gu of rank one to five, but it cannot restrict Immortal Gu. No blessed lands can restrict Immortal Gu abilities. Fang Yuan takes her remaining rank four Gu instead.",
